---
---

<section class="mku" id="mk-ueber-uns">
  <div class="mk-container mku-grid">

    <div class="mku-text mk-reveal">
      <span class="mk-eyebrow">Über Velaro</span>
      <h2 class="mku-h2">
        Kulinarik mit Charakter — seit Tag eins.
      </h2>
      <p class="mku-p">
        Velaro steht für ein Catering, das mehr will als nur satt machen.
        Wir kombinieren die Geradlinigkeit moderner Streetfood-Küche mit
        dem Anspruch eleganter Bankett-Tradition.
      </p>
      <p class="mku-p">
        Jedes Gericht — vom Canapé bis zum Festtagsbuffet — wird frisch
        in unserer Manufaktur in Haldensleben zubereitet und am Eventtag
        persönlich von uns serviert.
      </p>
      <div class="mku-stats">
        <div class="mku-stat">
          <div class="mku-stat-k">100%</div>
          <div class="mku-stat-v">Frisch zubereitet</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mku-stat mku-stat-border">
          <div class="mku-stat-k">2012</div>
          <div class="mku-stat-v">Seit über 12 Jahren</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mku-media mk-reveal">
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555244162-803834f70033?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop"
        alt="Köche bei der Arbeit"
        class="mku-img"
        loading="lazy"
        width="600"
        height="750"
      />
      <blockquote class="mku-quote">
        <span class="mku-qmark">"</span>
        <p class="mku-qtext">
          Ein Catering, das Persönlichkeit hat — und es schmeckt man in jedem Bissen.
        </p>
      </blockquote>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
.mku {
  background: var(--mk-bg);
  padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
}
.mku-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  align-items: center;
}
.mku-h2 {
  font-family: var(--mk-serif);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-style: normal;
  font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);
  line-height: 1.1;
  color: var(--mk-cream);
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}
.mku-p {
  font-size: 0.97rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: rgba(243,235,220,0.65);
  max-width: 50ch;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}
.mku-stats {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  margin-top: 2rem;
  padding-top: 2rem;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(243,235,220,0.1);
}
.mku-stat { padding-right: 2rem; }
.mku-stat-border {
  padding-left: 2rem;
  border-left: 1px solid rgba(243,235,220,0.1);
}
.mku-stat-k {
  font-family: var(--mk-serif);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-style: normal;
  font-size: 2.5rem;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--mk-accent);
}
.mku-stat-v {
  font-family: var(--mk-sans);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 0.62rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--mk-text-mute);
  margin-top: 0.375rem;
}
.mku-img {
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 4/5;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center;
  border: 2px solid rgba(243,235,220,0.15);
  border-radius: 0;
  display: block;
}
.mku-quote {
  margin-top: -1px;
  padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
  background: var(--mk-bg-card);
  border: 1px solid rgba(243,235,220,0.08);
  border-top: 3px solid var(--mk-accent);
  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(243,235,220,0.12);
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 1rem;
}
.mku-qmark {
  font-family: var(--mk-serif);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-style: normal;
  font-size: 2.5rem;
  line-height: 0.75;
  color: var(--mk-accent);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.mku-qtext {
  font-family: var(--mk-serif);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-style: normal;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--mk-cream);
}

@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .mku-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .mku-grid > .mku-media { order: -1; }
}
</style>
